    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "Behind the technical name GloVe, what intuitive problem were researchers confronting?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "GloVe learned word vectors by fitting ratios of global word co-occurrence probabilities. It connected count-based matrix factorization with neural embedding practice and became a widely used baseline representation.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-glove-global-vectors-for-word-representation"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "That sounds like a promising direction. What mechanism actually makes it work?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "A co-occurrence matrix is weighted, factorized, and turned into dense vectors where semantic relations become geometric directions.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-glove-global-vectors-for-word-representation"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "Why did the idea outlive one paper or experiment? What did later researchers actually inherit?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Experts generally treat GloVe as an influential bridge between distributional statistics and embedding models. Its long-term legacy is the global co-occurrence view that remained useful even after contextual language models became dominant.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-glove-global-vectors-for-word-representation"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "SUMMARY",
            "text": "GloVe mattered not only as a result, but as a method that later researchers could test, adapt, and extend.",
